{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.68]DY Krazy\n[00:02.64]I'm high\n[00:05.06]Real life\n[00:09.60]Tarentino\n[00:10.08]Somebody in the back got bronchitis\n[Chorus]\n[00:21.78]I'm gon' catch a vibe then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[00:26.06]I'm gon' find my high then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[00:29.96]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)\n[00:35.30]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)\n[00:38.98]I'm have to revive then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[00:45.04]I'm trying to find my high then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[00:51.54]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)\n[00:55.88]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:58.90]Tatted on me that shit is forever (is forever)\n[01:00.80]Tatted on me that shit is forever (is forever)\n[01:02.88]I started an empire it took some effort (took some effort)\n[01:08.38]But now I'm finna rule the world, forever\n[01:11.30]Run up on me I got that K on my back\n[01:12.98]I put that shit to yo' ass\n[01:14.58]Choppa on me it's gon' blast\n[01:16.24]Prolly leave a nigga in the past\n[01:17.76]Everyday I count up, quick cash\n[01:19.14].40 on me make it fly, jet lag\n[01:20.72]Ksubi jeans on me, no sag\n[01:22.72]And my Birkin shit, no bag\n[01:24.38]Run up on me then you get toe tagged\n[01:26.02]Choppa on me it hit you in the forehead\n[01:27.68]Three shots, three shots you dead\n[01:29.36]Now yo' mama callin' the feds\n[01:30.80]Talking about look what happened to my baby\n[01:32.72]Man look what yo' baby did, huh, damn\n[01:36.26]Look at yo' baby he dead, huh, damn\n[01:39.56]That's as trill as it gets, that is real as it gets, uh\n[01:42.94]I'm from a city where niggas show no pitty, they got gorillas in here\n[01:46.26]Rocket launchers too\n[01:47.94]Prolly catch you while walkin', up in school\n[01:50.86]Uh 'ey, on the news, uh, uh\n[01:53.34]Channel crew, uh, uh, bitch don't get involved\n[01:56.74]We will break yo' back just like the fucking law\n[02:00.46]Run up on me then I'm sending you up to god\n[02:03.00]I put that on God, everyday I been going hard\n[Chorus]\n[02:05.82]I'm gon' catch a vibe then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[02:07.52]I'm gon' find my high then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[02:10.48]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)\n[02:12.56]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)\n[02:14.12]I'm have to revive then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[02:16.36]I'm trying to find my high then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[02:19.26]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)\n[02:21.54]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:25.10]I'll pull your bitch, pull the trigger, then pull yo' car\n[02:27.50]Just like Chris Brown or some, we may stomp the yard\n[02:29.34]Fucking with us it's over with, I swear to god\n[02:35.86]Niggas talking that shit but they don't mean nothing to us\n[02:41.58]I'm on world tour, I'm starting to see some stuff\n[02:49.94]But that's not enough, according to you it's not\n[03:00.22]You say you seen the darkness, you say you seen the light\n[03:02.34]I say I've seen the same shit but just in different spots\n[03:04.20]I'm from Chicago where they shoot you without asking\n[03:06.60]And if you got a nice car they pull may you out yo' aston\n[03:08.54]You from a different place, it's not as tragic\n[03:10.18]You're too good for me\n[03:11.14]I'm too good for you\n[03:11.88]What you wanna do\n[03:12.48]What you wanna do\n[03:13.28]I've been through so much, I make my mistake\n[03:14.98]This is real love though I ain't with the fakes\n[Chorus]\n[03:16.94]I'm gon' catch a vibe then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[03:18.58]I'm gon' find my high then I'm gone (then I'm gone)\n[03:20.10]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)\n[03:21.30]You ain't getting money what you on (what you on)","words":[[1.68,1.74,"DY"],[2.06,2.5,"Krazy"],[2.64,2.72,"I'm"],[2.98,5.02,"high"],[5.06,5.42,"Real"],[6.34,8.1,"life"],[9.6,10.04,"Tarentino"],[10.08,13.36,"Somebody"],[14.88,15.78,"in"],[15.82,1